# Reasons and responsibility
#
# causes, enables, motivates, karma, moral, fulfils, foreshadowed. Each reason keeps its own voice
# . Order in time alone is never a reason.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m14_causes> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Reasons and responsibility" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: prov:wasInfluencedBy

iy:Reason a owl:Class .

iy:reasonOf a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:reasonKind a owl:ObjectProperty .
